```makefile
# .env.example

# Database settings
POSTGRES_USER=pharmacy_db
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=secure_password
POSTGRES_HOST=localhost
POSTGRES_DB=pharmacy_db

# Secret key for JWT authentication
JWT_SECRET_KEY="super-secret-key-for-jwt"

# API Endpoints and URLs
API_URL="http://localhost:3000"
API_VERSION="/api/v1"

# JWT settings
JWT_EXPIRATION_TIME=3600  # in seconds
JWT_REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRATION_TIME=86400  # in seconds

# Other settings
DB_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=5000  # in milliseconds
```

Please note that you should replace the placeholders (e.g., `pharmacy_db`, `secure_password`) with your actual database credentials and secret key. Also, ensure that the JWT token refresh time is set correctly for production use cases.